#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:3 136e4b8b08994daaa8a47a92d67e34c4
msgid "uBlox GPS Management Module"
msgstr "uBlox GPS管理模块"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:9 eeb9bdc8afc64ec9b99532d464bcc655
msgid ""
"The ublox module allows the user to upload GNSS databases (almanacs) from "
"the uBlox website to a uBlox GPS module. This is useful for getting a "
"quicker position lock under poor signal conditions. See `here "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/assistnow>`_ for details about this database."
msgstr ""
"ublox模块允许用户从uBlox网站向uBlox "
"GPS模块上传GNSS数据库（星历表）。在信号条件较差时，这有助于更快地获取位置锁定。有关该数据库的详细信息，请参见 `此处 "
"<https://www.u-blox.com/en/assistnow>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:15 1fe86df8efab49628bbbe2f5ff9b4cb3
msgid ""
"To use the uBlox API you will need to create a file containing your API "
"token in ``~/.mavproxy/ublox/api_token``."
msgstr "要使用uBlox API，需要在 ``~/.mavproxy/ublox/api_token`` 中创建一个包含API令牌的文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:18 4c77fa2f569e42e68c67d96232eddcb2
msgid "ublox reset"
msgstr "ublox reset"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:20 ced7da1983ba42aab348c7636a070ef2
msgid "This command reboots the GPS module. Also known as a \"cold start\""
msgstr "此命令重启GPS模块，也称为「冷启动」。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:23 6625f832f8794d5799750d8218979f78
msgid "ublox status"
msgstr "ublox status"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:25 3e77e202691f4455ad0b3004bd7ac2c9
msgid "Returns the current status of the GPS"
msgstr "返回GPS的当前状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:28 8f65540656b243d480fa297c38d77e5b
msgid "ublox mga"
msgstr "ublox mga"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ublox.rst:30 91a0eabbb7774b6e9f7ea8cb41e91fdb
msgid ""
"Upload the mga database from to the GPS module. It is assumed that "
"``offline.ubx`` and ``dbd.ubx`` are in the ``~/.mavproxy/ublox`` folder."
msgstr ""
"将mga数据库上传到GPS模块。假设 ``offline.ubx`` 和 ``dbd.ubx`` 位于 ``~/.mavproxy/ublox`` "
"文件夹中。"
